('Is the result consistent across seeds?','At plate level, yes: all six X seed/context contrasts are adverse. X43 contrasts are −0.08265160 and −0.10186606. At source level only eleven of twelve contrasts are adverse: X23/FULL/20261021 improves by approximately +0.00158. This exception is retained in the main text and detailed tables.'),
