('Do bands overlap known boundaries?','No accepted High95 area is within 1 mm of actual loaded X caps. Critical-source cap distances are 12.4000 mm G07, 11.0500 mm X10 and 12.9000 mm X23; their gauge-node distances are also nonzero. X10 touches the scoring core X edge (34.44% of its high area within 1 mm); that edge is not a physical FE boundary. Native cap/gauge positions were verified on all thirteen actual selected M2 meshes.'),
